  "content": "<p>附魔說明旨在透過在附魔物品的工具提示上添加效果描述，來釐清附魔的實際功用。大多數模組的附魔也支援！本模組支援超過15種語言，包括西班牙文、中文、俄文和法文！同時也支援所有主流模組載入器，包含<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-descriptions/files/all?gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-descriptions/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-descriptions/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-descriptions/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a>。</p><p><img src=\"https://docs.darkhax.net/assets/enchantment-descriptions/enchanted_item.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"></p><h2>依賴項</h2><p>本模組需要<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bookshelf\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bookshelf</a>庫。使用Fabric/Quilt的玩家也可以考慮安裝<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tooltipfix\" rel=\"nofollow\">ToolTipFix</a>模組，該模組能修復原版中工具提示超出螢幕邊緣的錯誤。Forge和NeoForge已內建此修復。</p><h2>設定與自訂</h2><p>添加新的描述或修改現有描述非常容易。還有許多設定選項可幫助您個性化調整模組。您可以在我們的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.darkhax.net%252fmods%252fenchantment-descriptions%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>上了解更多關於這些選項的資訊。&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://assets.blamejared.com/nodecraft/darkhax.jpg\" alt=\"Nodecraft 贊助標誌\" width=\"1080\" height=\"40\">本專案由 Nodecraft 贊助。使用折扣碼 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fnodecraft.com%252fr%252fdarkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\">DARKHAX</a> 首次服務可享七折優惠！</p><p><img src=\"https://skulk.blmj.red/enchantment-descriptions\" alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\"></p>",
